    {
      "id": "claim_30e157b2c11a4c03b076a66f28517ea7",
      "statement": "Integration tests support parameterized testing of multiple models/configurations via @pytest.mark.parametrize. Each parameter combination generates a separate cassette file (e.g., test_invoke[model0].yaml.gz, test_invoke[model1].yaml.gz), allowing independent recorded interactions for different model variants.",
