        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_150d3ea6225d45dd9187d0a97ab6047b",
      "statement": "OpenAI Codex tests require special VCR handling in CI: conftest.py skips Codex tests at collection time unless running in --record-mode=none (cassette playback), and uses monkeypatch to stub _FileChatGPTOAuthTokenProvider token methods with fake in-memory tokens for VCR playback without requiring on-disk OAuth files.",
