    {
      "id": "claim_7d605667c6f04ced95e6049010ae706f",
      "statement": "LangChain integration tests can be run in multiple modes via pytest record-mode flags: --record-mode=once (default, records new cassettes, replays existing); --record-mode=new_episodes (always records, overwrites existing cassettes); --record-mode=none (playback-only, fails if cassette missing, used in CI).",
